<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds close mixed, mood uncertain.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds close mixed, mood uncertain.</headline>
<text>
<p>1725 GMT - Bonds close mixed with the immediate direction uncertain, traders said. The market taking lead from Spain with the 10-year spread remaining around 10 basis points.</p>
<p>*June 97 futures down four basis points at 107.53</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 99.22 vs 99.15.</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -11 bps vs -8 bps</p>
